     2064   PROCEDURE enable_UI :
     2065     DISPLAY fi-db
     2066         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     2067     ENABLE b-exit b-chg-menu b-help BROWSE-menu fi-db
     2068         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     2069     VIEW FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     2070     RUN refresh-query.
     2071   END PROCEDURE.
     2072   PROCEDURE post_enable_UI :
